Package: adlaplaceGrf
Type: Package
Title: FEM Matern Gaussian Random Fields for adlaplace
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person(given = "Patrick", family = "Brown",
    email = "patrick.brown@utoronto.ca",
    role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Author: Patrick Brown [aut, cre, cph]
Maintainer: Patrick Brown <patrick.brown@utoronto.ca>
Description: Tensor-product B-spline finite-element ingredients for Matern
    Gaussian random fields (mass, stiffness, and higher-order Grams) for use
    with the adlaplace Laplace approximation framework. Provides design and
    Gram matrix construction on regular grids, with optional terra SpatRaster /
    SpatVector input, and AD tape builders for random_fem_2 / random_fem_3.
SystemRequirements: CppAD, OpenMP
License: GPL-3
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0),
    adlaplace (>= 0.4.0)
Imports: methods, stats, Matrix, splines, Rcpp
LinkingTo: Rcpp, adlaplace, RcppEigen, trustOptim, Matrix
Suggests: terra, testthat (>= 3.0.0), quarto, geostatsp, INLA, knitr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
VignetteBuilder: quarto
Encoding: UTF-8
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
